@startuml
actor Staff
participant SearchReservationServlet
participant PrintBillServlet
participant ReservationDAO
participant BillingService
database MySQL

Staff -> SearchReservationServlet : GET /searchReservation?resNo=RES-...
SearchReservationServlet -> ReservationDAO : findByReservationNo()
ReservationDAO -> MySQL : JOIN reservations, users, rooms
SearchReservationServlet --> Staff : reservation_search.jsp
Staff -> PrintBillServlet : GET /printBill?resNo=RES-...
PrintBillServlet -> ReservationDAO : findByReservationNo()
PrintBillServlet -> BillingService : countNights + calculate totals
BillingService --> PrintBillServlet : nights, roomTotal, serviceFee, grandTotal
PrintBillServlet --> Staff : bill.jsp (print / Save as PDF)
@enduml
